/*=============================================================================
	NxGenerated.h: the PhysX 2.8.4 descriptors and SDK interfaces, reconstructed from the shipped
	binaries.

	DISHONORED(layout|written): generated by build/agentAL_gen_physx.py from PhysXCore.pdb and
	PhysXCooking.pdb (Dishonored_Debug2012\Binaries\Win32; both DLLs are byte-identical to the
	retail 2013 ones, resources/docs/binaries.md). Nothing comes from an NVIDIA SDK: every member
	offset and every vtable slot is what the shipped DLLs carry (resources/tools/pdb/dia_types.py),
	and each descriptor's setToDefault() body is decoded from the DLL's own compiled copy of that
	inline function at the rva named on the class. Descriptors the DLLs never instantiate say so and
	zero their members instead - build/agentAL_gen_notes.txt lists them.

	Do not edit by hand: re-run the generator. The hand-written neighbours are NxVec3/NxMat33/
	NxMat34/NxQuat/NxBounds3/NxMath (value types), NxUserAllocator/NxStream/NxUserOutputStream/
	NxUserEntityReport (the callbacks the engine implements), NxArray and NxActorDesc.
=============================================================================*/

